flowchart LR
    subgraph Clients
        Desktop[Desktop App]
        Web[Web SPA]
        Mobile[Mobile App]
    end

    Desktop --> Gateway[API Gateway / Facade]
    Web --> Gateway
    Mobile --> Gateway

    subgraph Backend
        Gateway --> Catalog[Services Catalog]
        Gateway --> Contracts[Contracts]
        Gateway --> Support[Technical Support]
        Gateway --> Capacity[Capacity Management]
        Gateway --> Admin[Admin & RBAC]
        Gateway --> Notifications[Notifications]
    end

    Catalog --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    Contracts --> DB
    Support --> DB
    Capacity --> DB
    Admin --> DB
    Notifications --> Queue[(Message Queue)]
    Notifications --> Email[Email/SMS/Push Provider]
